黄昏の風景と共に嘆き
Lamenting alongside the twilight scenery,

413
00:49:29,572 --> 00:49:31,572
ぶっ壊されるだけだ
It's only going to be smashed.

414
00:49:31,572 --> 00:49:32,572
judgement

415
00:49:33,072 --> 00:49:37,572
君は彩り 嬉々 靡舌 「畜生に何を願う?」とあざ笑うキリギリス
You are colorful, joyous, lashing your tongue— "What could you wish for as a beast?" sneers the grasshopper.

416
