502
00:59:40,544 --> 00:59:56,604
あの、ファンの皆さんがね、あの、そんな強い気持ちでね、あの、あの作ってくれた歌でしたから、あの、え、とても気持ちを込めて歌わせいただきました！ありがとうございます！
Since it was a song created with such strong feelings by fan supporters, um, I sang it with all my heart! Thank you!

503
01:00:00,506 --> 01:00:01,896
近づいてきました。
It's getting closer.

504
01:00:03,036 --> 01:00:04,236
最後に
And finally,

505
01:00:04,636 --> 01:00:05,996
もう1曲だけ
just one more song...

506
01:00:06,436 --> 01:00:10,456
上のあれ 歌わせてもらってもいいですか?
Would it be alright if I sang that song?

507
01:00:11,256 --> 01:00:12,256
聞いてください。
Please listen.

508
01:00:41,316 --> 01:00:46,016
目を閉じれば 億千の星
If you close your eyes, a billion stars,

509
01:00:46,556 --> 01:00:51,436
一番光るお前がいる
the brightest one is you.

510
01:00:52,216 --> 01:00:56,636
初めて一途になれたよ
For the first time, I could be devoted.

511
01:00:57,256 --> 01:01:02,256
夜空へ響け 愛のうた
Ring out into the night sky, song of love.

512
01:01:21,916 --> 01:01:25,056
大親友の彼女の連れ おいしいパスタ作ったお前
You made delicious pasta with your best friend's girlfriend,

513
01:01:25,276 --> 01:01:29,556
家庭的な女のタイプの俺 一目惚れ
and I, a fan of the homely type, fell at first sight.

514
01:01:29,836 --> 01:01:33,936
大貧民負けてマジ切れ それ見て笑って楽しいねって
Losing at Daihinmin and getting mad, you laughed and said it was fun,

515
01:01:34,076 --> 01:01:36,976
優しい笑顔にまた癒されて ベタ惚れ
and your gentle smile healed me all over again.

516
01:01:37,356 --> 01:01:41,836
嬉しくて嬉しくて柄にもなくスキップしてスキップして
So happy, so happy, I skipped along out of character,

517
01:01:42,076 --> 01:01:45,056
「好きって言ってって」おもろね
asking "tell me you love me," how amusing.

518
01:01:45,216 --> 01:01:49,996
月を見つめる君に釘付け 守りたい女って
Glued to you gazing at the moon, wanting to protect you—

519
01:01:50,156 --> 01:01:54,496
思った初めて まじめな顔して ぎゅっと抱きしめた
for the first time, with a serious face, I hugged you tight.

520
01:01:54,896 --> 01:01:59,436
目を閉じれば 億千の星 一番光るお前がいる
If you close your eyes, a billion stars, the brightest one is you.

521
01:01:59,976 --> 01:02:03,836
初めて一途になれたよ 夜空へ響け 愛のうた
For the first time, I could be devoted. Ring out into the night sky, song of love.

522
01:02:04,036 --> 01:02:08,616
目を閉じれば 億千の星 一番光るお前がいる
If you close your eyes, a billion stars, the brightest one is you.

523
01:02:09,216 --> 01:02:13,816
初めて一途になれたよ 夜空へ響け 愛のうた
For the first time, I could be devoted. Ring out into the night sky, song of love.

524
01:02:14,116 --> 01:02:18,516
あれからずっと一緒だよな お前と俺
We've been together ever since, you and I.

525
01:02:18,816 --> 01:02:23,056
最近付き合いないと言われるけど
People say we haven't acted like a couple lately,

526
01:02:24,376 --> 01:02:29,036
なんかんだ温かく見守ってくれてる 優しい連れ
but you're a kind partner who somehow warmly watches over me.

527
01:02:29,456 --> 01:02:34,316
「なあ」変な愛称で呼ぶなよ 皆バカカップルと思うだろう
"Hey," don't call me by weird nicknames, everyone will think we're a silly couple.

528
01:02:34,516 --> 01:02:39,236
でもいつも落ち込んだ時 助けてくれる お前の優しい声
But whenever I'm feeling down, your gentle voice always helps me out.

529
01:02:39,616 --> 01:02:44,476
きっとお似合いな二人 共に解り合って 重なり合っても
Surely we're a matching pair, even when we understand and embrace each other,

530
01:02:44,876 --> 01:02:49,556
折り合いがつかない時は 自分勝手に怒鳴りまくって
when we can't compromise, I selfishly yell and scream.

531
01:02:49,836 --> 01:02:54,576
パチンコ屋逃げ込み 時間つぶして 気持ち落ち着かせて
Fleeing to a pachinko parlor to kill time and calm down,

532
01:02:54,936 --> 01:02:59,876
景品の化粧品持って 謝りに行こう
let's go apologize with some prize cosmetics.

533
01:03:00,176 --> 01:03:04,376
目を閉じれば 大好きな星 あんなに輝いてたのに
If you close your eyes, my favorite star shone so brightly back then,

534
01:03:04,736 --> 01:03:09,436
今では雲がかすんだまま それが何故かも分からぬまま
but now the clouds remain hazy, and I don't even know why.

535
01:03:09,916 --> 01:03:14,376
会いに 会いに行くよ… 会いに…
I'm going to see you, I'll go see you...

536
01:03:14,636 --> 01:03:19,556
会いに 会いに行くよ… 会いに…
To see you, I'll go see you...

537
01:03:19,916 --> 01:03:23,236
桜並木照らすおぼろ月 出逢えたふたりの場所に
To the place where we met, under the hazy moon illuminating the cherry trees.

538
01:03:45,716 --> 01:03:50,136
桜並木照らすおぼろ月 出逢えたふたりの場所に
To the place where we met, under the hazy moon illuminating the cherry trees.

539
01:03:50,456 --> 01:03:54,836
帰りに一人寄り道 変わらぬ景色 変わったのは俺ら二人
Stopping by alone on the way back—the scenery unchanged, only the two of us changed.

540
01:03:55,176 --> 01:03:59,636
全て見えていたつもり 目に見えないものなのに
Believing we could see everything, even though it was invisible to the eye...

541
01:03:59,996 --> 01:04:04,476
慣れ合いを求める俺 新鮮さを求めるお前
I sought familiarity, while you sought something fresh.

542
01:04:04,656 --> 01:04:08,856
お前は俺のために なのに俺は俺のために
You did it for my sake, yet I did it only for myself.

543
01:04:09,296 --> 01:04:13,576
春の夜風に打たれ 想い出に殴られ
Beaten by the spring night wind, battered by memories,

544
01:04:14,076 --> 01:04:18,396
傷重ねて 気付かされた 大事なもの握りしめ
accumulating scars, I realized what truly mattered, clutching it tight.

545
01:04:18,756 --> 01:04:23,036
今すぐ会いに行くよ 手をつないで歩こう
I'm going to see you right now, let's walk hand in hand.

546
01:04:47,616 --> 01:04:52,076
今すぐ会いに行くよ 手をつないで歩こう
I'm going to see you right now, let's walk hand in hand.

547
01:04:52,456 --> 01:04:56,496
絶対離さない その手をぼろぼろになっても
I'll never let go of that hand, even if it becomes battered and worn.

548
01:04:56,976 --> 01:04:59,596
嬉しくて嬉しくて柄にもなく好きで好きで
So happy, so happy, out of character, I love you so much.

549
01:05:00,154 --> 01:05:03,204
あたしの分だけの幸せ
Happiness just for me,

550
01:05:03,204 --> 01:05:05,604
ふたりで感じて
feeling it together,

551
01:05:05,604 --> 01:05:08,604
生きていこうぜ
let's keep living on!

552
01:05:10,504 --> 01:05:14,904
ラブソング もうひとりじゃ生きていけねえよ
A love song—I can't live alone anymore!

553
01:05:14,904 --> 01:05:20,104
そばにいて当たり前と思ってたんだ
I always took having you by my side for granted.

554
01:05:20,504 --> 01:05:25,104
ラブソング もう悲しませたりしねえよ
A love song—I won't make you sad anymore!

555
01:05:25,104 --> 01:05:29,604
空に向けオレは誓ったんだ
I swore to the sky above.

556
01:05:29,904 --> 01:05:36,104
ラブソング 下手くそな歌で愛を
A love song—with a clumsy tune,

557
01:05:36,104 --> 01:05:40,904
ばかな男が愛を歌おう
let a fool sing of love!

558
01:05:41,004 --> 01:05:46,104
一緒に隣で生きていってくれよ
Walk right beside me and stay with me!

559
01:05:46,104 --> 01:05:52,104
ラブソング 何度でも何度でも
A love song—over and over again!

560
01:05:56,104 --> 01:06:01,104
ラブソング なんでも話そう
A love song—let's talk about anything!

561
01:06:01,104 --> 01:06:04,604
ラブソング ラブソング
A love song, a love song!

562
01:06:05,104 --> 01:06:09,604
ラブソング 約束しよう
A love song—let's make a promise:

563
01:06:09,604 --> 01:06:16,904
音を散らせ 億千の星
let the sounds scatter across billions of stars,

564
01:06:16,904 --> 01:06:22,104
一番光るオマエがいる
where you shine the brightest of all.

565
01:06:22,104 --> 01:06:29,604
初めて一途になれたような 夜空へ響け あの歌
Resound across the night sky where I first learned devotion!

566
01:06:30,304 --> 01:06:36,604
目を閉じれば億千の星
Closing my eyes, billions of stars,

567
01:06:37,104 --> 01:06:42,604
一番光るオマエが欲しい
I want you, who shine the brightest of all!

568
01:06:43,104 --> 01:06:50,604
突き抜けてた夜はもう二度と 忘れず届く 愛の歌
A song of love reaching through nights I'll never forget!

569
01:07:03,604 --> 01:07:12,104
皆さん、今日は来てくれて、お誕生日をお祝いしてくれて、本当にありがとうございました！
Everyone, thank you so much for coming today and celebrating my birthday!

570
01:07:12,904 --> 01:07:15,604
ちゃんと歌えてたかな？
Did I sing it well, I wonder?

571
01:07:15,904 --> 01:07:19,604
まだまだ若いぞ！
I'm still young!

572
01:07:19,604 --> 01:07:27,604
でも、今日は本当にありがとう！お誕生日おめでとう自分！
But truly, thank you so much today! Happy birthday to me!

